 "notes": "Malek 2, a fringing-reef wall and drift dive about 15 minutes by speedboat south of Brayka Bay: the reef edge with a sand channel cutting into the reef flat, a terrace of coral blocks and pinnacles at 10-24 m and a drop-off to about 40 m. The layout is laid along the OpenStreetMap reef edge at an assumed scale (coastline © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL). The position is estimated from the boat times from Brayka Bay (Nemo City 5 min, Malek 2 15 min, Marsa Egla 20 min south) and may be off by a kilometre or more along this straight coast; the boat drop point is assumed. All positions are approximate.",
